id: pm-7qg4jz
title: Validate declared MCP boolean options before mutation normalization
description: "PR1541 inline review4344126276 identifies boolean mutation values discarded by optionTrue before persistence. Independent current public stdio reproduction with options.clearComments=42 and a sibling title returns changed_field_count1 and writes the title. Derive strict boolean admission from canonical action parameter schemas and aliases, preserve valid false values and supported polymorphic metadata such as regression, and refuse malformed values before item/history writes. Keep custom project fields outside unrelated action parameter types."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-22T03:13:46.009Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T04:13:13.798Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-22T04:13:12.705Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-22T04:13:12.705Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 45
acceptance_criteria: Reproduce malformed clearComments through the public MCP entrypoint before the fix; Validate all declared action boolean parameters and equivalent aliases before normalization; Preserve valid true/false options and nested precedence without constraining custom fields by unrelated parameter types; Cover create and update atomic refusals with exact durable snapshots and strict hosted gates
parent: pm-gh1538
risk: medium
confidence: 100
severity: medium
resolution: "Derive strict boolean checks from canonical action parameter schemas and registration aliases before normalization, including force and top-level receipt controls, while preserving custom fields and polymorphic metadata."
expected_result: "Malformed declared boolean options refuse with changed=false before any item/history write; valid true/false values, aliases, nested precedence and project-defined fields retain their semantics."
actual_result: "Both create/update regressions fail before the guard and pass afterward. Malformed clear/replace/exception/duplicate and receipt flags preserve exact item/history snapshots; true clearing and false preservation work, regression=0 stays supported, and custom offline string metadata persists. Public stdio refuses clearComments=42 without changing the item. All linked tests, packed npm/Bun executors, the full 10,982-test suite and complete static command pass; exact coverage is 100/100/100/100."
