comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T03:13:46.009Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: fresh request search, open/in-progress inventories and complete3056-item strict all-status/full corpus with no omissions found no owner for malformed MCP boolean flags. Read the completed scalar and array admission lineage live. This distinct review finding is independently reproduced on the revised PR head and stays in the same grouped delivery."
  "2026-10-22T03:20:11.562Z","harness:codex","The new create/update regressions both fail on the revised published PR head before this correction. The SDK now derives strict boolean admission from canonical action parameter schemas and registration aliases before normalization. Valid false flags and a real true clear operation pass; receipt controls reject non-booleans, polymorphic regression metadata still accepts zero, and a custom offline string field is preserved despite an unrelated global parameter of that name. All nine linked tests pass. The independent public stdio control now refuses clearComments=42 with changed=false and retains the original title."
  "2026-10-22T04:13:11.784Z","harness:codex","Final local verification: all 10,982 tests pass with 3 skips. Exact coverage is 100/100/100/100 over 70,263 statements, 54,026 branches, 14,479 functions and 66,578 lines, with zero uncovered counts. The complete static command now passes, including both independent advisory feeds across all 568 locked versions with zero findings, import-cost and transport budgets, graph/context/record assurance and mutation testing. Both linked commands pass: the nine focused regressions plus maintained packed npm/npx/Bun/bunx smoke over nine packages. Valid true/false flags, aliases, receipt controls, polymorphic regression metadata and an unrelated-name custom field retain behavior. Required exact-head hosted checks and rereview still precede merge."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T03:20:12.184Z","harness:codex","Boolean flag readers often reduce any non-true value to an absent option. Validate declared types before coercion and scope shared parameter metadata to the actual action, so custom fields do not inherit unrelated command types. Include valid false, true side effects, aliases and polymorphic metadata as compatibility controls."
